---
import { chernModel, fhsChernNumber } from '../../../data/part06/ch25TeachingModels.mjs';
const initialChern = fhsChernNumber(chernModel.mass.default, chernModel.grid.default, false);
---

  <figure class="chapter-visual chern-mesh-explorer" data-chern-mesh-explorer>
    <figcaption>
      <strong>原创交互模型 C：离散全 BZ Chern 数</strong>
      <span lang="en">Original interactive model C: discrete full-BZ Chern number</span>
    </figcaption>

    <div class="chapter-visual__controls visual-controls--three">
      <label>
        <span>质量参数 m | Mass parameter</span>
        <input type="range" min="-3" max="3" step="0.1" value="-1" data-chern-mass />
        <output data-chern-mass-output>−1.0</output>
      </label>
      <label>
        <span>网格 N×N | Grid</span>
        <select data-chern-grid>
          {chernModel.grid.allowed.map((grid) => <option value={grid} selected={grid === chernModel.grid.default}>{grid}×{grid}</option>)}
        </select>
      </label>
      <label class="checkbox-control">
        <input type="checkbox" data-chern-gauge />
        <span>施加确定性 k 依赖规范 | Apply deterministic k-dependent gauge</span>
      </label>
    </div>

    <svg viewBox="0 0 680 230" role="img" aria-labelledby="chern-title chern-desc">
      <title id="chern-title">Chern-number phase regions of a two-band square-lattice model</title>
      <desc id="chern-desc">Four mass regions are labelled zero, minus one, plus one, and zero. Gap closings at minus two, zero, and plus two separate the regions.</desc>
      <rect x="50" y="75" width="145" height="70" class="phase-region phase-region--trivial" />
      <rect x="195" y="75" width="145" height="70" class="phase-region phase-region--minus" />
      <rect x="340" y="75" width="145" height="70" class="phase-region phase-region--plus" />
      <rect x="485" y="75" width="145" height="70" class="phase-region phase-region--trivial" />
      <text x="122" y="116" text-anchor="middle">C = 0</text>
      <text x="267" y="116" text-anchor="middle">C = −1</text>
      <text x="412" y="116" text-anchor="middle">C = +1</text>
      <text x="557" y="116" text-anchor="middle">C = 0</text>
      <line x1="50" y1="165" x2="630" y2="165" class="visual-axis" />
      <text x="45" y="190">−3</text>
      <text x="188" y="190">−2</text>
      <text x="335" y="190">0</text>
      <text x="480" y="190">2</text>
      <text x="620" y="190">3</text>
      <line x1="243.3" y1="52" x2="243.3" y2="172" class="mass-marker" data-chern-marker />
      <circle cx="243.3" cy="52" r="7" class="mass-marker-point" data-chern-marker-point />
    </svg>

    <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
      <span data-chern-gap>minimum direct gap = {initialChern.gap.toFixed(4)}</span>
      <span data-chern-raw>flux / 2π = {initialChern.raw.toFixed(8)}</span>
      <strong data-chern-value>C = {initialChern.chern}</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
      <p><strong>Hamiltonian：</strong><code>H(k) = sin(kx) σx + sin(ky) σy + [m+cos(kx)+cos(ky)] σz</code>。占据下带，BZ 取 <code>[−π,π)²</code>，方向为 <code>(kx,ky)</code> 与 <code>+z</code> 法向。</p>
      <p lang="en"><strong>Hamiltonian:</strong> <code>H(k) = sin(kx) σx + sin(ky) σy + [m+cos(kx)+cos(ky)] σz</code>. The lower band is occupied on <code>[−π,π)²</code>, oriented by <code>(kx,ky)</code> and the <code>+z</code> normal.</p>
      <p><strong>离散：</strong>每条网格边使用归一化重叠，单个 plaquette 的相位取主支，全部 plaquette 相加后除以 <code>2π</code>。测试区间为 <code>m &lt; −2</code>、<code>−2 &lt; m &lt; 0</code>、<code>0 &lt; m &lt; 2</code> 和 <code>m &gt; 2</code>。</p>
      <p lang="en"><strong>Discretization:</strong> each mesh link uses a normalized overlap; the principal plaquette phase is summed over the complete mesh and divided by <code>2π</code>. The tested regimes are <code>m &lt; −2</code>, <code>−2 &lt; m &lt; 0</code>, <code>0 &lt; m &lt; 2</code>, and <code>m &gt; 2</code>.</p>
      <p><strong>验收：</strong>网格 <code>N=11,21,41,61</code> 在代表点给出 <code>C=0,-1,+1,0</code>；施加确定性 k 依赖相位后整数不变；<code>m=-2,0,2</code> 闭隙时界面必须显示“不定义”，不能沿用旧标签。</p>
      <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> grids <code>N=11,21,41,61</code> return <code>C=0,-1,+1,0</code> at representative masses; a deterministic k-dependent phase leaves the integer unchanged; at <code>m=-2,0,2</code> the interface must report “undefined” rather than retain a stale label.</p>
      <p><strong>边界：</strong>接近整数的单次结果不构成收敛证明。真实材料还需要稳定的占据流形、结构与 SOC 条件、对称性核验、k 网格收敛，以及与直接 ab initio 或经验证 Wannier 表示的一致性。</p>
      <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> one nearly integral result is not a convergence proof. A material calculation additionally requires a stable occupied manifold, controlled structure and SOC, symmetry checks, k-mesh convergence, and agreement with direct ab initio states or a validated Wannier representation.</p>
    </div>
  </figure>

<script>
  import { fhsChernNumber } from '../../../data/part06/ch25TeachingModels.mjs';
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-chern-mesh-explorer]').forEach((root) => {
    const massInput = root.querySelector('[data-chern-mass]');
    const gridInput = root.querySelector('[data-chern-grid]');
    const gaugeInput = root.querySelector('[data-chern-gauge]');
    const massOutput = root.querySelector('[data-chern-mass-output]');
    const gapOutput = root.querySelector('[data-chern-gap]');
    const rawOutput = root.querySelector('[data-chern-raw]');
    const valueOutput = root.querySelector('[data-chern-value]');
    const marker = root.querySelector('[data-chern-marker]');
    const markerPoint = root.querySelector('[data-chern-marker-point]');
    if (!(massInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(gridInput instanceof HTMLSelectElement) || !(gaugeInput instanceof HTMLInputElement)) return;

    const update = () => {
      const mass = Number(massInput.value);
      const grid = Number(gridInput.value);
      const result = fhsChernNumber(mass, grid, gaugeInput.checked);
      const markerX = 50 + ((mass + 3) / 6) * 580;
      if (massOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) massOutput.value = mass.toFixed(1).replace('-', '−');
      if (gapOutput instanceof HTMLElement) gapOutput.textContent = `minimum direct gap = ${result.gap.toFixed(4)}`;
      if (rawOutput instanceof HTMLElement) rawOutput.textContent = result.valid ? `flux / 2π = ${result.raw.toFixed(8)}` : 'flux / 2π = undefined at gap closing';
      if (valueOutput instanceof HTMLElement) valueOutput.textContent = result.valid ? `C = ${result.chern}` : 'C = undefined: occupied band is not isolated';
      if (marker instanceof SVGLineElement) {
        marker.setAttribute('x1', markerX.toFixed(2));
        marker.setAttribute('x2', markerX.toFixed(2));
      }
      if (markerPoint instanceof SVGCircleElement) markerPoint.setAttribute('cx', markerX.toFixed(2));
    };
    massInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    gridInput.addEventListener('change', update);
    gaugeInput.addEventListener('change', update);
    update();
  });
</script>
